    "chunk_text": "\u00f0e mycle weorce \u00fe\u00e6t he swa ungefullad for\u00f0feran sceolde. Getreowde hine \u00f0a hw\u00e6\u00f0re on \u00feone \u00e6lmihtigan Gode mid ealle mode & on his mildheortnesse. Eode he \u00f0a hw\u00e6\u00f0re in \u00fe\u00e6t hus \u00fe\u00e6r se lichama inne l\u00e6g, & het \u00fea o\u00f0re men ealle ut gangan, & he \u00f0a \u00d0a he \u00f0a lange hwile swa in \u00feam gebede w\u00e6s, \u00f0a ongeat he \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6r w\u00e6s godcund m\u00e6gn andweard, \u00dea w\u00e6s ymbe hwile \u00fea gefylde he his lare lufian, for \u00fean he swa cu\u00f0e & Godes gife on him w\u00e6s & his & he manig tempel & deofulgild gebr\u00e6c & gefylde, & he \u00feonne \u00fe\u00e6r asette Godes cirican, o\u00f0\u00f0e fullice & \u00fe\u00e6t gelamp sume si\u00f0e eac \u00fe\u00e6t he ongan onb\u00e6rnan sum deofolgild \u00fe\u00e6t mid \u00feam h\u00e6\u00f0enum mannum \u00dea stod \u00fe\u00e6r sum nyttwyr\u00f0e hus bi \u00f0am h\u00e6\u00f0engilde \u00fee he \u00fe\u00e6r b\u00e6rnan ongan. \u00dea slog se wind \u00feone lig on \u00fe\u00e6t nyttwyr\u00f0e hus, & him \u00feuhte \u00fe\u00e6t hit eall forb\u00e6rnan sceolde. \u00dea he \u00f0a, sanctus Martinus, \u00fe\u00e6t geseah, \u00fea arn he sona up on \u00fe\u00e6t hus, & gestod he ongen \u00feam lige. \u00dea gelamp wundorlice wyrd, \u00fe\u00e6t se lig ongan slean & brecan ongen \u00feam winde, & efne swa swa se & swa w\u00e6s \u00fea se lig ge\u00fereatod \u00feurh sancte Martines gebedu, \u00fe\u00e6t he n\u00e6nigum o\u00f0rum \u00feingum ne Swylce gelamp o\u00f0er wund",
